{"4753530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sunny Spot Cat's ramble", "steam_appid": 4753530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sunny Spot Cat's ramble&quot; is a multiplayer 3D action game where you play as a cat and lounge around in sunny spots to compete for the longest lounging time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you lounge, the more points you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash across 3D stages filled with high and low platforms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash around every which way, head for the spawning sunny spots, and aim for the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snuggle up and lounge together in harmony, or kick the others out to monopolize the best spot...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotage your rivals with various items, outsmart everyone, and stack up more points than anyone else!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Online Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 cats gather from all over the web! Start a casual, chaotic party anytime with your long-distance friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Set a password, and you can even host a &quot;secret cat gathering&quot; just for your squad!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Offline Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plug in your controllers, and it’s an instant battle for up to 4 cats with friends and family right in front of the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A local cat gathering starts on the spot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will you chill and lounge together peacefully, or ruthlessly sabotage the friend sitting next to you with items? It’s all up to you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Just make sure to make up after the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "a